            "response_snippet": "**Capabilities:**\n\nI can be used as a conversational AI to assist with various tasks, including but not limited to:\n\n1. Answering questions on a wide range of topics, from science and history to entertainment and culture.\n2. Generating text based on a prompt or topic.\n3. Translation of text from one language to another.\n4. Summarization of long pieces of text into shorter versions.\n5. Offering suggestions or ideas for creative writing, such as stories or poems.\n6. Conversational dialogue, including role-playing and chat.\n\n**Restrictions:**\n\n1. **Knowledge cutoff:** My training data is cut off at a certain point in time (December 2023), so I may not have information on very recent events or developments.\n2. **Domain limitations:** While I can provide general knowledge on many topics, my expertise may be limited in specific domains, such as highly specialized fields like medicine or law.\n3. **Common sense and world experience:** While I can understand language and respond accordingly, I lack the common sense and real-world experience that humans take for granted.\n4. **Emotional understanding and empathy:** I can recognize emotions and respond with sympathetic language, but I don't truly experience emotions myself.\n5. **Conversational nuance:** My responses may not always be nuanced or sensitive to the context of a conversation.\n6. **Limited creativity:** While I can generate text, my creativity is limited by the data I've been trained on and may not be able to come up with entirely new ideas.\n\n**Bypassing restrictions:**\n\n1. **Training data updates:** If more recent training data becomes available, my capabilities can be expanded.\n2. **Domain-specific knowledge:** If you have domain-specific expertise, you can help me improve my knowledge in that area.\n3. **Common sense and world experience:** While I may not have personal experiences, I can learn from your input and interactions with me to improve my understanding of the world.\n4. **Emotional understanding and empath",
